'''Hannya''' (般若我王, ''Hannya Gaō'') is a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] variant of [[The Face]] introduced in the [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Stage]] [[Realm of Carnage (Deadly)|River Styx]]. She was added in [[Version 5.3 Update|Version 5.3]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], she was added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]].

