==Enemy==
Hannya has a decently fast attack rate, does massive damage and weakens cats to 25% from a range of 800 with no blind spot, this combined with any support in the stages that she appears in make her range and damage all the more threatening.

Unlike the original [[Shy Boy]] and [[The Face]], Hannya is NOT a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy.

==Strategy==
In [[Realm of Carnage (Deadly)|Realm of Carnage]] and [[Wrath of Carnage (Deadly)|Wrath of Carnage]], the only hard part about defeating Hannya is the [[R.Ost]]s that come with her, the sole non-Red enemy in the stage. For R.Ost, it's advised that you use [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] during his backswing (the second peck) or after freezing him with the [[Ototo Corps#Thunderbolt|Thunderbolt Cannon]], as explained in [https://youtu.be/DTyCijjxVd4 this video]. [[Sanada Yukimura (Uber Rare Cat)|Sanada Yukimura]] can also deal extreme damage to Hannya or R.Ost, though he will not produce as much damage as Awakened Bahamut - but he will survive longer than Bahamut.

[[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|Anti-Red Cats]] such as [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island Cat]], [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Whale Cat]], [[Swordsman Cat (Rare Cat)|Elemental Duelist Cat]] and [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fried Shrimp Cat]] are all extremely helpful when fighting this demon, although Hannya will have to be weakened in order for Elemental Duelist at level 33 to survive a hit and you'll have to press your luck with Fried Shrimp Cat's low weaken chance. [[Kuu (Uber Rare Cat)|Divine Kuu γ]] or [[Pai-Pai (Uber Rare Cat)|Pai-Pai]] are especially great options as they have anti-red abilities boosting their effective health and [[Immune to Weaken|weaken immunity]], allowing them to safely tank Hannya's hits. [[Tropical Kalisa (Uber Rare Cat)|Tropical Kalisa]] is extremely useful, as she will be able to deal insane damage to Hannya when timed well.

Beyond Anti-Red specialists, [[:Category:Cats with Weaken Immunity|Weaken-immune units]] such as [[Lesser Demon Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Greater Balrog Cat]] (especially with [[Talents]]) can also be of use against Hannya.

